    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ This is a map, not an automation\n\nEvery node here is a **No-Op**: it does nothing, sends nothing, and charges nobody. It exists so the business can be read on a canvas instead of in a document.\n\nPress **Execute Workflow** to walk the path — each step lights up in order, and clicking one shows its description.\n\n**Never set these Active.** The workflows that actually run are the numbered ones in the folder above (01–05).",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-31104",
      "name": "Note 31104",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -960,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Free, and useful immediately\n\nM1–M6 cost the merchant nothing. They walk away with a page they can use in their Instagram bio the same day.\n\n**Why give it away:** a free page keeps them somewhere we can reach them, and it is the cheapest proof that we do what we say.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 250,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-83574",
      "name": "Note 83574",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Where the money starts\n\nM7–M10 is the whole business: they pay, we build, we feature them.\n\n**The rule that protects you:** the store only opens on a cleared payment, never on a request.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 250,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-49619",
      "name": "Note 49619",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### What keeps them\n\nM11–M12: orders arriving on their phone is the habit. The renewal cycle runs itself, and suspension takes the store — never the page, the links, or the products.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 230,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "note-53819",
      "name": "Note 53819",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        280
      ]
    }
